# Amazon India Sales Analysis

## Project Overview
This project analyzes Amazon India sales data to explore sales performance, order trends, and business patterns using Microsoft Excel and Power BI.

## Tools & Technologies
- Microsoft Excel
- Power Query
- PivotTables
- Descriptive Statistics
- Sales Forecasting
- Power BI

## Analysis Areas
- Sales Performance and Monthly Trends
- Order Status and Fulfillment Methods
- Buyer Type Analysis
- Product Category and Size Analysis
- Shipping Service Analysis
- Average Order Value (AOV)
- Sales Forecasting

## Key Findings
- Sales declined by approximately 23% from April to June.
- Amazon fulfillment generated higher total sales than Merchant fulfillment.
- Consumer orders accounted for the vast majority of sales.
- Expedited shipping contributed more sales than Standard shipping.
- Sales performance varied across product categories and sizes.

## Project Files
- **Excel Workbook:** Data preparation, analysis, PivotTables, and forecasting.
- **PDF Report:** Analytical approach, key findings, business implications, recommendations, and limitations.
- **Power BI Dashboard:** Interactive visualization of sales performance and order trends.

## Objective
To transform raw sales data into meaningful insights and support data-driven business understanding.
